37572>>>>>>>        // Close after save
37572>>>>>>>        Send NavigateClose Self
37573>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
37574>>>>>>>
37574>>>>>>>    // this will close the view after a delete
37574>>>>>>>    Procedure OnViewDeleted Handle hoDDO
37577>>>>>>>        Send NavigateClose Self
37578>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
